    "note": "In the checkout 7 of the 9 Lab files default their target module to the client module 'WrightFlood' (LabAction.cs:15, LabAggregate.cs:14, LabBlock.cs:13 and 17, LabData.cs:13, LabMisc.cs:19, LabScreen.cs:14, LabUi.cs:16). The release overlays of lane V (scripts/release/overlay/<folder>/Lab*.cs.patch) make the default 'ODC3_Lab' (--module names the real module) and put the LabBlock block in MainFlow."
  },
